              "text": "રેડવું (reḍvũ) is inherited, but its source is not settled. CDIAL lists it, glossed \"to pour\", under Sanskrit raya, \"stream\", and again under recayati, \"empties\", and says it may come from either (CDIAL 10638, 10811)."
